#, icu-message-format
msgctxt "shareAppText"
msgid ""
"Badge Magic is an app to control LED name badges. This app provides features "
"to portray names, graphics and simple animations on LED badges. You can also "
"download it from below link https://play.google.com/store/apps/"
"details?id=org.fossasia.badgemagic"
msgstr ""

