#, icu-message-format
msgctxt "aboutBadgeMagic"
msgid ""
"Badge Magic is an app to control LED name badges. The goal is to provide "
"options to portray names, graphics, and simple animations on LED badges. For "
"the data transfer from the smartphone to the LED badge we use Bluetooth. The "
"project is based on the work of Nihlcem."
msgstr ""

